<title>USA: Hudson Chartered begins trading on AMEX.</title>
<headline>Hudson Chartered begins trading on AMEX.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hudson Chartered Bancorp Inc, parent of First National Bank of Hudson Valley, on Monday said its shares began trading on the American Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>Previously, the company's stock was traded on the Nasdaq.</p>
<p>The shares were 1/8 higher at 28-7/8 late Monday afternoon.</p>
